<title>NETHERLANDS: ASM win $3 million furnace orders.</title>
<headline>ASM win $3 million furnace orders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semiconductor equipment maker ASM International NV said on Monday it had won new Far Eastern orders worth $3 million for its Advance 400 vertical furnaces.</p>
<p>&quot;The Company will ship two dual tube Advance 400 vertical furnaces, with a total value of $3 million, to the advanced development lines of Hyundai of Korea and Vanguard, located at Hsin-Chu, Taiwan.&quot;</p>
<p>ASM International, headquartered at Bilthoven, Netherlands, designs, manufactures and markets equipment and materials used to produce semiconductors</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
